        "text_preview": "3] This\ncriminal appeal has been filed by appellant Shivdarshan Sharma under Section 374 of Cr.P.C.\nagainst the judgement dated Neutral Citation No. 2024:Mphc-Ind:27708 Cra 1533-1999\n30.10.1999, passed in Special Case No.35 of 1993 by I Add"
